<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Linux on aLong</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/linux/</link><description>Recent content in Linux on aLong</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/linux/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ubuntu22.04安装kubeadm</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubuntu22.04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85kubeadm/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubuntu22.04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85kubeadm/</guid><description>学习k8s做笔记，通过kubeadm搭建1master、2node。网络插件：flannel。系统Ubuntu22.04 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubuntu22.04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85kubeadm/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>通过minikube部署K8S学习环境</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87minikube%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2k8s%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87minikube%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2k8s%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</guid><description>Minikube 是本地 Kubernetes，专注于让 Kubernetes 易于学习和开发。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87minikube%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2k8s%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>linux环境redis开机启动</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83redis%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jan 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83redis%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>系统部署在ubuntu20.04中，用到redis数据库。 但是测试时候，设备重启发现redis服务没有启动。 由于是变异安装的，系统找不到redis.service。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83redis%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Linux重启后Docker设置自动启动&amp;容器自动启动设置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>系统重启后，如果docker没有启动，那么docker下所有的服务就都挂了。 配置过一次总是忘记命令，这里特意记录一下： systemctl enable docker.service &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centos5不升级内核更新</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0/</guid><description>公司需要环境Centos5, 又不能升级内核. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ubutun16.04安装Python</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun16-04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85python/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 May 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun16-04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85python/</guid><description>安装python3.7.3 安装pip &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun16-04%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85python/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centos7时间设置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>date hwclock 硬件时间 timedatectl 各时间状态 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centos7防火墙相关设置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>以前都是用iptables，公司服务器环境事7，凑巧不熟一台新服务。我为了测试，再本地虚机上装了一台。 这里默认防火墙是 firewall，其实为了省事还是可以安装一个iptables的。这里学习一下firewall一些操作。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centos7启动等级设置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>启动级别分为7个： 0 - 系统停机状态 1 - 单用户工作状态 2 - 多用户状态（没有NFS） 3 - 多用户状态（有NFS） 4 - 系统未使用，留给用户 5 - 图形界面 6 - 系统正常关闭并重新启动 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ubutun下安装Docker</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/</guid><description>具体信息请参考官方。官方概述（养成看文档习惯） &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>